ayload that unpacks the stage 2 binary loaded into memory.\r\n-- While we have some indicators that StealC is assocaited with this infection chain, we have not yet confirmed.\r\n+- While we have some indicators that StealC is associated with this infection chain, we have not yet confirmed.\r\n \r\n Payload Analysis: Execution and Core Capabilities\r\n \r"}]}